+**Editing Transforms (for selected points):**
+*   **Deletion:** Set density $\sigma_i = 0$. Color $\mathbf{c}_i$ is irrelevant as the term $(1 - \exp(-\sigma_i \delta_i))$ becomes 0 [S1].
